clueweb09-en0007-85-36505.135 Dutchess County Travel Spotlight Feed books* on the subject of FDR irst 100 Days with a combined value of $45- $55. Publication Date: 9 January 2009 Books on FDR: Fear and Learning in Those Pages The story of how FDR wrote " the only thing we have to fear is fear itself." Opinion by G.E. "Skip" Lawrence, of The Phoenix. Publication Date: 8 January 2009 Warm Your Way to Spring with Good Friends & Great Food Come and get it! Sprout Creek Farm announces they now make soups and breads each week on a limited basis for sale in their Poughkeepsie market. The soups are frozen so you can defrost and serve whenever hunger calls. Warm your way to spring with good friends, good food, and hearts full of hope. Publication Date: 8 January 2009 Dutchess Tourism Welcomes New Tour and Travel Manager Director of Dutchess County Tourism Mary Kay Vrba announces that Dawn Hopper
clueweb09-en0007-85-36505.270 Dutchess County Travel Spotlight Feed and Travel Manager Director of Dutchess County Tourism Mary Kay Vrba announces that Dawn Hopper of Kingston has joined the staff of Dutchess County Tourism as the tour and travel marketing manager. Prior to working at the tourism office, she held positions as senior sales manager at the Hudson Valley Resort & Spa, business development manager at Eisenhower Hall Theatre at the U.S. Military Academy at West Point and director of sales for Broadway producers Dodger Theatricals in New York City. Publication Date: 23 December 2008 Tourism Information Center at Vassar College Finding out about things to see and do in Dutchess just got easier. Spend less time planning and more time sightseeing by visiting the new Tourism Information Center at Vassar College. Publication Date: 21 December 2008 Dutchess County Basketball With the NBA season in full swing, fans of all ages have gotten into the spirit of jump shots,
