clueweb09-en0001-57-15337.135 Agri-Tourism About Us Experience first-hand the rich agricultural bounty that comes from Dutchess County, NY! The small, individual- and family-owned farms and vineyards located throughout the heart of the Hudson Valley are a sight to behold. In addition to preserving the scenic landscape, they provide great-tasting food and beverages, as well as play an important role in supporting the local economy. For more information, click on the links below. And remember, “Think Dutchess” when it comes to food, farms, art and fun! [blue arrow] Dutchess County Agricultural Info [blue arrow] Stay, Eat/Drink & Shop Farm Fresh [blue arrow] Metro-North Railroad Getaways [blue arrow] Individual & Group Itineraries [line] [Farm Fresh Coloring Book] Farm Fresh Activity and Coloring Book Dutchess County Tourism is pleased to present a Farm Fresh themed coloring and activity book for kids. Designed by local artist Tilly Strauss. Activity and Coloring Book Flash Document (for fast viewing) Activity
