clueweb09-en0007-85-36494.135 Agri-Tourism About Us [farmers market] Craving a taste of Dutchess County? Spend the night in one of our B&Bs and wake up to the sights, smells and tastes of a real farm-fresh breakfast. Relax and enjoy some great conversation over an artfully prepared meal. Savor the flavor of our nationally recognized wines or sip a tall, cool glass of Hudson Valley Fresh milk. And no visit to the county is complete without bringing back a sample of your farm-fresh experience from one of the many farms, farmers markets, specialty stores and galleries that dot the local landscape. [blue arrow] Stay [blue arrow] Eat/Drink [blue arrow] Shop [blue arrow] Farms & Markets [cia-culinary] [bikingpastfarm] [vineyards] About DCT | Advertise with Us | Contact Us | Privacy Policy | Terms of Use | Home (C) 2008 Dutchess County Tourism. All rights reserved. Dutchess County Tourism, 3 Neptune Rd., Suite Q-17, Poughkeepsie NY 12601
