clueweb09-en0007-85-36518.0 Dutchess County Tourism Search Events Calendar: Search Events by Location: All Amenia Annandale-on-Hudson Beacon Beekman Clinton Corners Dover Plains Fishkill Germantown Hopewell Junction Hyde Park LaGrange Lagrangeville Millbrook Millerton Pawling Pine Plains Pleasant Valley Poughkeepsie Poughquag Red Hook Rhinebeck Staatsburg Stanford Stormville Tivoli Wappingers Falls Wassaic Wingdale RESOURCES Properties Property News Maps & Directions Photo Gallery Press Room Contact Us About Us Home Meeting and Event Planning Professionals When Considering Locations For Your Next Meeting, Conference Or Special Occasion Think Dutchess! Whether you’re planning a small to mid-sized conference, business off-site meeting, corporate outing or special event, Dutchess County has a variety of spaces that will exceed your expectations. Find out whats new. See Property News . Convenient Location : nestled along the historic Hudson River mid-way between New York City and Albany, Dutchess County offers easy access to major highways and train stations, as well as public and private air service. Diverse
clueweb09-en0007-85-36518.135 Dutchess County Tourism to major highways and train stations, as well as public and private air service. Diverse Facilities & Accommodations: from full-service hotels to quaint country inns and creative “alternatives” to the typical banquet facilities, Dutchess County boasts more than 2,800 hotel rooms and 30,000 square feet of flexible meeting and event space. In addition, our properties can provide state-of-the-art AV equipment, high-speed Internet access, catering and other personalized services to help make your meeting or event a standout success. Year-Round Attractions & Entertainment : whatever your area of interest – historic sites, cultural and artistic institutions, wine and fine dining, outdoor recreation or world-class educational facilities – Dutchess County offers it all. Notable points of interest include: Historic Sites: Franklin D. Roosevelt Presidential Library & Museum, Locust Grove/Samuel Morse Historic Site, Mount Gulian Historic Site, Rhinebeck Aerodrome Museum & Air Show and the Vanderbilt Mansion Culture & The Arts: The Bardavon
clueweb09-en0007-85-36518.270 Dutchess County Tourism Aerodrome Museum & Air Show and the Vanderbilt Mansion Culture & The Arts: The Bardavon Opera House, Dia: Beacon Museum for the Arts and the Richard B. Fisher Center for the Performing Arts Fine Dining and Wineries plus artisanal foods, farms and markets Outdoor Recreation: hiking, biking, sailing, fly-fishing, ballooning, horseback riding, skiing, snow-shoeing plus breathtaking scenery and fall foliage Educational Institutions: Bard College, Dutchess Community College, Marist College, The Culinary Institute of America, The Omega Institute and Vassar College Plus so much more… Meeting Planner Assistance : Dutchess County Tourism staff members are available to assist you in planning your next meeting or conference. Our knowledgeable and friendly professionals can provide materials and artwork along with community relations support to help you make the most efficient use of your time in the Hudson Valley. Materials: quantities of the Dutchess County Travel Guide and suggested itineraries for participants, as well
clueweb09-en0007-85-36518.405 Dutchess County Tourism Materials: quantities of the Dutchess County Travel Guide and suggested itineraries for participants, as well as a DVD or PowerPoint presentation of area sites and services for key decision-makers. Artwork: access to color photography, maps and logos for reproduction in meeting materials, promotional flyers and mailers. Community Relations: assistance in developing local contacts and coordinating efforts with area officials, media, properties and attractions. For A Memorable Meeting, Conference Or Event Experience, Think Dutchess! Learn more about our properties About DCT | Advertise with Us | Contact Us | Privacy Policy | Terms of Use | Home (C) 2006 Dutchess County Tourism. All rights reserved. Dutchess County Tourism, 3 Neptune Rd. Suite Q-17, Poughkeepsie NY 12601 Tel: 845/463-4000 or 800/445-3131 The programs provided by this agency are partially funded by monies received from the County of Dutchess.
clueweb09-en0007-85-36530.0 Dutchess County Tourism Search Events Calendar: Search Events by Location: All Amenia Annandale-on-Hudson Beacon Beekman Clinton Corners Dover Plains Fishkill Germantown Hopewell Junction Hyde Park LaGrange Lagrangeville Millbrook Millerton Pawling Pine Plains Pleasant Valley Poughkeepsie Poughquag Red Hook Rhinebeck Staatsburg Stanford Stormville Tivoli Wappingers Falls Wassaic Wingdale Group Tours Press Room Advertise With Us Contact DCT About DCT Home Our Privacy Policy DutchessTourism.com is committed to respecting your privacy. We will not sell, rent, lease or loan your personally identifiable information to anyone. Period. Dutchess Tourism.com generally collects personally identifying information with your specific knowledge and consent. For example, when you enter a contest or giveaway, complete a survey, or make a request for information, you are asked to provide your name, address, phone number or e-mail address. Dutchess Tourism will use this information to provide you with service you have requested, notify you that you have won a contest or send you
clueweb09-en0007-85-36530.135 Dutchess County Tourism service you have requested, notify you that you have won a contest or send you up-to-date information about Dutchess County Tourism. Please contact us is you have any comments or questions about our privacy policy. You may also want to read our Terms of Use below. Dutchess County Tourism Promotion Agency 3 Neptune Rd. Suite M-17 Poughkeepsie, NY 12601 dctpa@DutchessTourism.com Terms of Use Please read these terms carefully. Use of this website indicates that you accept these terms. Use of Site and Material You are prohibited from posting to this site any unlawful, threatening, libelous, defamatory, obscene, pornographic, or other material that would violate any law. You may download the materials at this website for your personal use, provided that you retain all copyright, source and other proprietary notices contained in the original materials on any copies of those materials. You may not modify the materials at this site in
