clueweb09-en0005-00-32601.135  Click the button below to view ALL SERVICES - includes both County and non-County. [Click to view both County and non-County Services] Text Size: [Normal Text Size] [Large Text Size] County Government >> County Government Services Directory [Services Directory] [Collage of Services] Service(s) Overview / Responsible Department or Agency (if applicable) FAQs e-Gov/On-line Service Geo Access Welcome to the County Government Services Directory... Here you will find a concise list of services provided to the public by Dutchess County and its Departments. County services will continue to be added to this directory as will FAQs corresponding to specific services. Click on a category listed in the Service Area menu to the left to view information about specific County Services including: General description of the service County Department that provides the service Link to the Service Page on the website Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) indicator- [FAQ indicator button]- that links the
clueweb09-en0005-00-32601.270  Page on the website Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) indicator- [FAQ indicator button]- that links the service to corresponding questions and answers. e-Government Service indicator- [e-Gov Service indicator button]- signifying the service can be accessed online and links to it on the website Location where the service is provided (if applicable) and mapped through Dutchess County's GeoAccess function - [Open GeoAccess Mapping function] We have expanded the service directory concept in our All Services Directory which includes not only County services but services provided by outside agencies and organizations as well. Click on [All Services button]located at the top of the Service Area menu listed on the left side of this page to find information about services that are provided by entities other than County Government. Go to top of page - Home - | - Legal Statements - | - How to Use this Site - | - Contact Us
